{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352821-recommend-some-fan-splats","id":1352821,"title":"Recommend some fan splats?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-12-05T08:46:06-08:00","id":1352821,"title":"Recommend some fan splats?","content":"Can anyone recommend some good homebrew resources for Abyssals and Sidereals? More charms/martial arts than anything else-- I'd love to have a better source to pull powers from when making NPCs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12314,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","user":"Grod_the_giant","date":". 12-05-2019, 11:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-05T12:38:22-08:00","id":1352855,"title":"","content":"Lanaya's Abyssals is pretty solid all things considered. As for Sidereals, Down Came A Spider (?) remains my preferred one, though I don't think I would use it on its own as much as look at several Sidereal brews and try to Frankenstein a fun encounter out of them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23684-alistair","name":"Alistair","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23684_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T11:40:53-08:00","id":1353070,"title":"","content":"I second Lanaya's Abyssals; unlike mine, it's got really focused, thought-out thematics and works to diverge from the Solar equivalent charms. There might be some balance questions, but I'unno.<br /> Similarly, I'm a huge fan of Lanaya's Infernals. It's... admittedly a good deal rougher, but it takes a rather good run at Ability-based Infernals and I would describe it as having good energy. Some things are wonky (the Ride tree is... basically a stick in the ground, though the few charms it does have are nice) but almost every tree reflects at least two Yozis except for like... a couple.<br /> <br /> Sidereal Brews... I'm aware of three (WFHL, Down Came the Spider, and Grifftopher's brew) and I agree that kind of frankensteining them for QC purposes is a good way to go.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8026-beans","name":"Beans","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8026_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"472"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-12-06T12:04:36-08:00","id":1353079,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Beans</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1352821-recommend-some-fan-splats?p=1353070#post1353070\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sidereal Brews... I'm aware of three (WFHL, Down Came the Spider, and Grifftopher's brew) and I agree that kind of frankensteining them for QC purposes is a good way to go.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which has the best Sidereal Martial Arts, would you say?<br /> <br /> (also, WFHL?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12314,"us